  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish support to ICT development in Rwanda started in January 2003 and has been directed to institutional capacity development of Rwanda Information Technology Authority (RITA). The support also included funds for implementation of a number of projects within the National Plan for Communication Infrastructure (NICI). The result of the support was that RITA was established and functionning.</narrative>
